              "content": "Return the daemon's own self-stats — uptime in seconds, `messages.last_msg_seen` in seconds since the last metric was received, and `messages.bad_lines_seen` since startup. Backends append their own keys (e.g., `graphite.last_flush`, `graphite.flush_time`).",
